# This is a file of tests for the GMOS sequencer in a suitable format to be read
# by the tcsTests.tk procedure.
# 
# This particular test file is aimed at checking the input ranges to 
# the GMOS 'grSelect' CAD command.
#
#
# Comments are introduced by a # in the first column
# Blank lines can be left if required.
# The currently allowed keywords are (case is immaterial)
#
#  Test   <testId>
#  Command <commandName>
#  Field   <CAD field> <value>
#  Response Accept | Reject
#  Timeout <msecs>
#  OnError Continue | Abort
#  Log     <recordName>
#  Directive Start | Preset

# This first part before the first Test keyword can be used to setup 
# global values for Response, TimeOut and OnError. These global values
# can be over ridden within specific tests

Response Reject
TimeOut  30000
OnError  Continue

Help
Help These tests checks the trapping of invalid input to the
Help grSelect command.
Help
Help The first tests check for null input. If the commands in question have
Help been run at any time after booting and prior to running these tests then
Help there will already be input on the CAD fields and so these null tests
Help will fail. To validate the trapping of null input you will have to
Help reboot the GMOS sequencer and start these tests again.
Help
Help Press continue when ready
Help

# Tests start here. Each test must start with the Test keyword, end with
# a Directive keyword and have at least one Command keyword. Any Field
# keywords are assumed to apply to the last command

Test UT04010
Summary Check rejection of null input
Help Check rejection of null input

 Command grSelect
 Field  A  ""
 Field  DIR MARK   
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT04020
Summary Check rejection of invalid input to Mode  field 
Help Check rejection of invalid input to Mode field 

 Command grSelect 
 Field  A  XXXXX
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT04030
Summary SEL mode: Check rejection of null input to grating name field
Help SEL mode: Check rejection of null input to grating name field

 Command grSelect 
 Field  A  SEL
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT04040
Summary SEL mode: Check rejection of invalid grating name
Help SEL mode: Check rejection of invalid grating name

 Command grSelect 
 Field  A  SEL
 Field  B  XXXXX
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT04050
Summary WLEN mode: Check rejection of invalid grating name
Help WLEN mode: Check rejection of invalid grating name

 Command grSelect 
 Field  A  WLEN
 Field  B  XXXXX
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start


Test UT04060
Summary WLEN mode: Check rejection of null input to Wavelength field
Help WLEN mode: Check rejection of null input to Wavelength field

 Command grSelect 
  Field  A  WLEN
  Field  B  800+
  Response  Reject 
  Directive Start

Test UT04070
Summary WLEN mode: Check rejection of invalid input to Wavelength field
Help WLEN mode: Check rejection of invalid input to Wavelength field

 Command grSelect 
  Field  A  WLEN
  Field  B  800+
  Field  C  XXXXX
  Response  Reject 
  Directive Start

Test UT04075
Summary WLEN mode: Check rejection of out-of-range input to Wavelength field
Help WLEN mode: Check rejection of out-of-range input to Wavelength field

 Command grSelect 
  Field  A  WLEN
  Field  B  800+
  Field  C  100.0
  Response  Reject 
  Directive Start


Test UT04080
Summary WLEN mode: Check rejection of null input to grating order field
Help WLEN mode: Check rejection of null input to grating order field

 Command grSelect 
  Field  A  WLEN
  Field  B  800+
  Field  C  0.4
  Response  Reject 
  Directive Start

Test UT04090
Summary WLEN mode: Check rejection of invalid input to grating order field
Help WLEN mode: Check rejection of invalid input to grating order field

 Command grSelect 
  Field  A  WLEN
  Field  B  800+
  Field  C  0.4
  Field  D  XXXXX
  Response  Reject 
  Directive Start

Test UT04100
Summary WLEN mode: Check rejection of out-of-range input to grating order field
Help WLEN mode: Check rejection of out-of-range input to grating order field

 Command grSelect 
  Field  A  WLEN
  Field  B  800+
  Field  C  0.4
  Field  D  -1
  Response  Reject 
  Directive Start


Test UT04110
Summary Check acceptance of valid grating-only  selection 
Help Check acceptance of valid grating-only  selection 

  Aftertest Pause

Log c2:grAssembly.A
Log c2:grAssembly.B
Log c2:grAssembly.C

 Command grSelect 
  Field  A  SEL
  Field  B  800+
  Response  Accept 
  Directive Start
 
Test UT04120
Summary Check acceptance of valid grating/tilt selection
Help Check acceptance of valid grating/tilt selection

  Aftertest Pause

Log c2:grAssembly.A
Log c2:grAssembly.B
Log c2:grAssembly.C

 Command grSelect 
  Field  A  WLEN
  Field  B  800+
  Field  C  0.4
  Field  D  1
  Response  Accept 
  Directive Start
 
Test UT04130
Summary WLEN mode: Check uninstalled grating name rejection reported OK
Help WLEN mode: Check uninstalled grating name rejection reported OK
#
#  NOTE: Substitute appropriate grating name for 'Field B' value
#

 Command grSelect 
 Field  A  WLEN
 Field  B  800-
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start
